{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":590,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["In-Game Reward information"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["It is not possible to get the virtual item attached to this product unless bought through the Roblox commercial store, which is the Merch Shop in the lobby."]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"Only players that reside in the United States of America, and are over the age of 13 (unless residing in the state of Texas, where this is over the age of 18) can access this store. Players outside the United States of America are able to purchase the physical product via ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://shop.paradoxum.games/"},"children":["Paradoxum Games store"]}," but will not get the virtual item attached to this product."]},"\n"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Pyromancer_Plush"},"children":["Pyromancer Plush"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCg"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n","\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Pyromancer Plush"]}," is an official Paradoxum Games toy. It was made by Juniper Creates™. The plushie offers the Default Level 5 ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Pyromancer","title":"Pyromancer"},"children":["Pyromancer"]},". Anybody who bought the toy from the in-game Merch Store will receive the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Plushie"]}]}," skin for ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Pyromancer","title":"Pyromancer"},"children":["Pyromancer"]},". If bought on the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://shop.paradoxum.games/"},"children":["Paradoxum Games store"]},", it will not come with any rewards."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["It is made out of plush fabric and polypropylene cotton, its size measures 11 inches (27.94 centimetres) tall, 8.3 inches (21.082 centimetres) wide and 9.4 inches (23.876 centimetres) deep. Its mask and flamethrower can be detached."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwFQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Official_Description"},"children":["Official Description"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Online (Third)"]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":["Turn up the heat with the new Pyromancer Plush. Equipped with a removable face shield and flamethrower, this fiery friend is sure to heat up your collection. Do not get burned by missing out and grab yours today. The in-game reward is only included with purchases made in Roblox. Items purchased from shop.paradoxum.games do not include an in-game reward."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Online (Second)"]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":["Turn up the heat with the new Pyromancer Plush! Equipped with a removable face shield and flamethrower, this fiery friend is sure to heat up your collection."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Online (First)"]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":["Turn up the he